    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bennetts Auctioneers are delighted to bring No. 9 Cranfield Place to the market. This  delightful three-bedroom family home is ideally positioned in the heart of Sandymount and just a short stroll from Sandymount Village and Sandymount Strand. The well-proportioned accommodation of c. 107 sq. m. briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, family room, kitchen, living/dining room, guest W.C. on the ground floor. Three double bedrooms and a family bathroom on the first floor complete the property. Features of the property include off street parking, oil fired heating, large balcony and a private and secluded rear garden.\r\n\r\nExternally to the front, there is off street parking  on a pebbled driveway. To the rear, a good sized private and secluded garden laid out in stone with mature shrubbery surrounding.\r\n\r\nViewing highly advised.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n\r\nIdeally situated in this most convenient location, the property is just a short stroll from the heart of Sandymount Village, with its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities. The scenic Sandymount Strand and promenade are also within easy walking distance. The area is renowned for its excellent choice of schools, including Star of the Sea BNS, Scoil Mhuire GNS, St Matthews, St. Michael's College and St. Conleth's College. Transport links are exceptional, with numerous bus routes and both Sandymount and Lansdowne DART stations nearby. The Aviva Stadium, the IFSC, Dublin's Silicon Docks and the city centre are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for both families and ."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch:  1.48m x 2.02m   tiled flooring, storage units\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:  4.96m x 2.33m   wood flooring, under stair storage  \r\n\r\nFamily room:  3.40m x 2.89m   wood flooring, built in wardrobes, window to front garden\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining room:  6.33m x 5.01m   wood flooring, recessed lighting, feature fireplace with granite surround, breakfast hatch to kitchen, dual sliding doors to rear garden \r\n\r\nKitchen:  2.00m x 2.57m   wood flooring, recessed lighting, range of floor and eye level unit, tiled splashback, stainless steel sink, integrated fridge freezer, oven with extractor fan, window to living room\r\n\r\nW.C.:  2.91m x 0.90m  tiled throughout, walk in shower unit, W.H.B., W.C.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\n\r\nLanding:  3.24m x 3.32m  carpet flooring, hot press\r\n\r\nMain bedroom:  2.92m x 5.15m   carpet flooring, built in wardrobes, window to rear garden, sliding doors to balcony\r\n \r\nBedroom 2:  3.44m x 2.89m   wood flooring, window to front\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  2.96m x 2.02m  carpet flooring, window to front  \r\n\r\nBathroom:  1.96m x 1.79m   tiled throughout, bath unit with shower extension, W.H.B., W.C., sky light \r\n\r\nExterior\r\n\r\nTo the front there is off street parking for one car on a pebbled driveway behind secure gates while to the rear a good sized private and secluded rear garden laid out in paving stones with mature shrubbery surrounds and two storage sheds.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: c.  107 sq. m."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming three bedroom mid terrace family home \r\n\r\nSuperbly located close to Sandymount Village and Strand\r\n\r\nExcellent potential to enhance and extend subject to P.P \r\n\r\nLarge private and secluded rear garden\r\n\r\nGated off street parking\r\n\r\nTotal floor area c. 107 sq. m."
      },
